      "answer": {
        "lead": "No, it's not too late, Noah. Your enrollment window runs through 2026-11-11, so you have until then to finish enrolling.",
        "policy_facts": [
          {
            "text": "Your Medical PPO election is still pending, with an enrollment window end of 2026-11-11. Your coverage would be effective 2026-11-01. Dental, Vision and 401(k) are also pending. Life is already enrolled.",
            "citations": [],
            "data_sources": [
              {
                "tool": "lookup_benefits_status"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "New hires have 30 calendar days from their hire date to enrol. The policy's own example is a hire on October 12, who can enrol until November 11. Your hire date of 2026-10-12 matches that example.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "3.1",
                "snippet": "New hires have 30 calendar days from their hire date to enrol in benefits through the HR Portal."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": [
              {
                "tool": "lookup_employee_profile"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "If you enrol within your window, coverage is back-dated to the first day of the month after your hire date. Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "1.2",
                "snippet": "Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage, so enrol early in your window."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          },
          {
            "text": "HR cannot extend the new-hire window. If you miss it, you may be without Ridgeline coverage until the next plan year, unless you have a qualifying life event before then.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "3.2",
                "snippet": "HR cannot extend the new-hire window, so missing it can leave you without Ridgeline coverage until the next plan year."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          }
        ],
        "recommendations": [
          {
            "text": "Enrol in the HR Portal under Benefits before 2026-11-11. Don't wait until the last day."
          },
          {
            "text": "If you're unsure what to choose, enrol in a plan now. You can change your choices at open enrollment."
          }
        ]
      },
