                  "text": "New hires have 30 calendar days from their hire date to enrol in benefits through the HR Portal. For example, an employee hired on October 12 can enrol until November 11. Coverage starts as described in \u00a71.2.\nEnrol in the HR Portal under Benefits. Choose your plans and coverage levels, add any family members you want to cover, and confirm. If you don't want a plan, you can waive it. Your choices then apply for the rest of the plan year.",
