                  "text": "Coverage starts on the first day of the month after your hire date. If you enrol within your new-hire window (\u00a73.1) after that date has passed, your coverage is back-dated to the first day of the month after your hire date.\nFor example, an employee hired in the middle of October is covered from the first day of November once they enrol, even if they enrol a few days into November. Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage, so enrol early in your window.",
